    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot starfighters with simulated cockpits and advanced hardware control as you fight to avoid blackout in close-quarter maneuvering fights of man over machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wage war over a player-driven persistent universe during humanity's last great civil war while avoiding humanity's extinction by a mysterious alien threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine resources and build a massive fleet to back up your starfighters as you fight for control over territory, resources, and key installations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form organizations within each faction and build a personal fleet for you and your friends to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break from the war and participate in competitive races and wargames between friend and foe alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512190/extras/cd606153c12335d0c46d048e08a75822.avif?t=1746839100\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot starfighters with simulated cockpits and advanced hardware control as you fight to avoid blackout in close-quarter maneuvering fights of man over machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wage war over a player-driven persistent universe during humanity's last great civil war while avoiding humanity's extinction by a mysterious alien threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine resources and build a massive fleet to back up your starfighters as you fight for control over territory, resources, and key installations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form organizations within each faction and build a personal fleet for you and your friends to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break from the war and participate in competitive races and wargames between friend and foe alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512190/extras/cd606153c12335d0c46d048e08a75822.avif?t=1746839100\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Hunternet is an MMO starfighter sim where you fight for territory, resources, &amp; key installations during humanity's last civil war. Form player orgs, mine resources, &amp; build fleets to back up your starfighters. Take a break &amp; fly in friendly races or wargames, but beware an alien foe threatens all.",
